# Liveness vs Readiness vs Startup

| Probe         | Question                    | Failure Result                  |
| ------------- | --------------------------- | ------------------------------- |
| **Startup**   | Have you finished starting? | Gives application time to start |
| **Readiness** | Are you ready for traffic?  | Pod becomes Not Ready           |
| **Liveness**  | Are you still alive?        | Container restarts              |

### Easy Memory

> **Startup → “Have you started?”**
> **Readiness → “Can you take traffic?”**
> **Liveness → “Are you alive?”**

### Most Important

**Liveness → Restart**

**Readiness → No Traffic**

**Startup → Give Time**

