# Useful Commands

Check Pod:

```bash
kubectl get pod probes-pod
```

Detailed Pod information:

```bash
kubectl describe pod probes-pod
```

Check only readiness information:

```bash
kubectl describe pod probes-pod | grep -A 5 "Readiness"
```

Delete Pod:

```bash
kubectl delete pod probes-pod
```

Recreate from YAML:

```bash
kubectl apply -f probes-pod.yaml
```

